<p class="is-style-bio-contact wp-block-paragraph">Jason Miu is an associate director in the New York Fed’s Markets Group.</p>



<div class="wp-block-media-text alignwide" style="grid-template-columns:16% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="180" height="180" src="https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2024/06/roberto-perli-newyorkfed.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-3182 size-full" srcset="https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2024/06/roberto-perli-newyorkfed.jpg 180w, https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2024/06/roberto-perli-newyorkfed.jpg?resize=150,150 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
