</div></div>



<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-media-text" style="grid-template-columns:24% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="920" height="576" src="https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/01/ttw-money-market-dynamics-920x576-1.jpg?w=920" alt="" class="wp-image-3725 size-full" srcset="https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/01/ttw-money-market-dynamics-920x576-1.jpg 920w, https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/01/ttw-money-market-dynamics-920x576-1.jpg?resize=300,188 300w, https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/01/ttw-money-market-dynamics-920x576-1.jpg?resize=768,481 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 920px) 100vw, 920px" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
