		<title>The Federal Reserve and its Monetary Policy Implementation Framework</title>
		<link>https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/2024/08/05/the-federal-reserve-and-its-monetary-policy-implementation-framework/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Eric LeSueur, Linsey Molloy, Will Riordan, and Josh Younger]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 13:00:42 +0000</pubDate>
