		<title>“A Real Trying Time”: Community Lender Gets Much&#8209;Needed Dough to Cheesesteak Restaurant</title>
		<link>https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/2020/10/08/a-real-trying-time-community-lender-gets-much-needed-dough-to-cheesesteak-restaurant/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Michelle Park Lazette, Senior Writer, Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2020 18:08:00 +0000</pubDate>
