		<title>“A Fish with Very Little Water”: Businesses Deep in the Desert Qualify for PPP Loans with Help from Rural Lender</title>
		<link>https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/2020/10/08/a-fish-with-very-little-water-businesses-deep-in-the-desert-qualify-for-ppp-loans-with-help-from-rural-lender/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Michelle Park Lazette, Senior Writer, Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2020 17:31:00 +0000</pubDate>
