		<title>Central Bankers and Balance Sheets</title>
		<link>https://tellerwindow.newyorkfed.org/2017/07/28/central-bankers-and-balance-sheets/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Julie Remache, Senior Vice President and Policy Advisor, and Antoine Martin, Senior Vice President and Head of Money &amp; Payments Studies]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 28 Jul 2017 14:05:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Monetary Policy Implementation]]></category>
